Brand words to use and avoid
title end

paragraph start
Keep two short lists, words to use and words to avoid, and put a reason beside every entry. Avoid claims that cannot be proven, such as guaranteed results, and any wording that misleads about money.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Review the lists after each batch of posts and add only words that appeared repeatedly. A long list nobody reads is worse than a short one people follow.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
word or phrase, use or avoid, reason
code end

